* Wed Sep 02 2026 fravaccaro - 0.1.4-2
- Normalise gradient coordinate systems so cairo-based renderers no longer clip
  gradient-filled shapes; fixes File Browser, MeeCast, ToDo List, AllRadio2,
  ownKeepass, Firefox and several Jolla launcher icons.
- Make %post idempotent: skip directories already relocated to ~/.themepack and
  repair stale symlinks, instead of failing on every upgrade.
- Undo that relocation in %preun so uninstalling no longer floods the terminal
  with "remove failed" warnings and leaves nothing behind.
- CI verifies the committed PNGs against their SVG sources instead of silently
  re-exporting them at build time.

* Sat Aug 15 2026 fravaccaro - 0.1.4-1
- Fix icon color space

* Sun May 31 2026 fravaccaro - 0.1.0-5
- Ship exported icon PNGs in the RPM (match Numix Circle packaging).
- CI runs themepack-helper before sfdk build.

* Sun May 31 2026 fravaccaro - 0.1.0-1
- Companion app for Muoto; DejaVu Sans fonts and Haiku-style icons.
- Tutorial launcher uses FAQ icon from hvif-store.art; app branded with Haiku leaf.
